vif?t=1752767312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914600/extras/ab128f931181d0e3881963726e84318d.webm?t=1752767312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914600/extras/ab128f931181d0e3881963726e84318d.mp4?t=1752767312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Easy to Play, Hard to Master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game controls are simple and intuitive just like old school arcade games, allowing everyone to start playing <i>Rail Fights</i> right away and enjoy it. However, the specific shape of the arena, combined with the tank\u2019s speed, target movements and missile speed can make aiming and timing shots counterintuitive at times. Only practice could make Rail Fighters overcome this challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Capture Your Launcher</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change your tank\u2019s firepower by hitting and capturing launcher tokens that appear in the arena. Different launchers, such as cannons, rockets, lasers, and grenade launchers, come with varying shooting speeds, cooldown times, and destructive power, requiring different strategies. The better the launcher, the scarcer it is, so try to be the first to capture one.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bumper Compression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If other tanks are pushing you around by force, just hold for a bit for your tank\u2019s bumpers to get compressed enough and kick them away from you; The tanks will be stalled for a short period after getting kicked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914600/extras/718c1a00aa6902cb8cb690a08b0f7181.poster.avif?t=1752767312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914600/extras/718c1a00aa6902cb8cb690a08b0f7181.webm?t=175276731